@startuml
title Adaptive concurrency: main components
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide empty members
class "collect_futures_with_progress" as Collector {
  collect_outcomes()
  fill_joinset()
}
class FuturesLimitRegistration {
  receiver()
  drop(): unregister
}
class FuturesLimits {
  register(descr)
  forget(descr)
  on_oom()
  on_ok()
  rebalance_future_limits()
}
class DynamicFutureLimit {
  watch sender / receiver
}
class SyncExecutionLimiter {
  shared budget and permits
}
class SyncStageRunner {
  execute attempt
  classify JobFeedback
}
class "Tokio JoinSet" as Tasks
Collector --> FuturesLimitRegistration : retains for invocation
FuturesLimitRegistration --> FuturesLimits : unregisters on drop
FuturesLimits *-- "per description" DynamicFutureLimit
FuturesLimits *-- SyncExecutionLimiter
Collector ..> DynamicFutureLimit : watches allowance
Collector --> Tasks : spawns within allowance
Tasks ..> SyncStageRunner : futures may submit stages
SyncStageRunner --> FuturesLimits : Oom / Success feedback
SyncStageRunner --> SyncExecutionLimiter : acquires shared permits
note bottom of Collector
  Ordered buffered completions also
  occupy the collector allowance.
end note
note bottom of FuturesLimits
  Rebalances on registration changes
  and budget adjustments.
  All device runners share the budget.
end note
@enduml
